Cc: linux-clk@vger.kernel.org, linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, linux-rockchip@lists.infradead.org, huangtao@rock-chips.com, cl@rock-chips.com, xxx@rock-chips.com, xf@rock-chips.com, Elaine Zhang <zhangqing@rock-chips.com>
